cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "NYC Beneficial Owner Resolution"
abstract: >-
  Reliability-typed beneficial-ownership resolution over NYC public records.
  Resolves false splits (probabilistic record linkage), pierces the shell game
  with a name-free deed veil-pierce (co-conveyance + linked-successor guard),
  and builds Owner Portfolios distinct from the operational network — each
  claim typed as directly-sourced or inferred, with a paired benchmark against
  JustFix's Who Owns What.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Flagg
    given-names: Robert
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # TODO
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bobflagg/nyc-beneficial-owner-resolution"
version: 0.1.0
# No DOI yet: the release is a tagged GitHub release. Add `doi:` here if the project is archived (e.g. on Zenodo).
keywords:
